# Research Figure Studio — public source only.
# Ignore rules do not remove already tracked files. Before committing, run:
#   python research-figure/scripts/check_repository.py --root . --tracked
# Keep private research, live jobs, editor settings and credentials OUTSIDE this repo.

# Root and package layout: reject unreviewed top-level additions.
